claim.claim-text:
a plurality of light emitting elements (120) for emitting lights; and
a light controller (130) disposed on the light emitting elements (120) for the lights passing through to form output lights, which is switchable in a first state (SU1) and a second state (SU2);
wherein a sum of an intensity of the output lights in the first state (SU1) is greater than a sum of an intensity of the output lights in the second state (SU2) in an angle ranged from 80° to 100°.

a first electrode (E1) and a second electrode (E2), wherein the light controller (130) is disposed between the first electrode (E1) and the second electrode (E2); and
a spacer (SP1) disposed between the plurality of light shielding elements (134) and the second electrode (E2);
wherein the plurality of switchable diffusers (132) are connected to each other through a gap existing between the plurality of light shielding elements (134) and the second electrode (E2).
